<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>标本论治 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E6%A0%87%E6%9C%AC%E8%AE%BA%E6%B2%BB/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.154.5 &amp; FixIt v0.4.2</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Sun, 25 Jan 2026 05:43:05 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E6%A0%87%E6%9C%AC%E8%AE%BA%E6%B2%BB/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>病本第二十五</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-25/</link><pubDate>Fri, 15 Aug 2025 18:44:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-25/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%81%B5%E6%9E%A2/">灵枢</category><description>病本是指疾病的根本。文中指出治病必须求疾病的根本之所在，并列举了七种先病和后病的情况，从治标和治本的先后，阐明中医标本论的重要治疗原则，故篇名为&amp;quot;病本&amp;quot;。</description></item><item><title>至真要大论篇第七十四</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE74%E8%87%B3%E7%9C%9F%E8%A6%81%E5%A4%A7%E8%AE%BA%E7%AF%87%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%83%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B/</link><pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE74%E8%87%B3%E7%9C%9F%E8%A6%81%E5%A4%A7%E8%AE%BA%E7%AF%87%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%83%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE/">素问</category><description>系统阐述了六气（风、热、湿、火、燥、寒）的周期性变化规律及其对人体病理生理的影响，提出了&amp;quot;天人相应&amp;quot;的整体观和&amp;quot;以平为期&amp;quot;的治疗原则，强调通过五味调理、方剂配伍和标本论治等方法实现阴阳动态平衡。</description></item><item><title>标本病传论篇第六十五</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE65%E6%A0%87%E6%9C%AC%E7%97%85%E4%BC%A0%E8%AE%BA%E7%AF%87%E7%AC%AC%E5%85%AD%E5%8D%81%E4%BA%94/</link><pubDate>Sat, 05 Apr 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE65%E6%A0%87%E6%9C%AC%E7%97%85%E4%BC%A0%E8%AE%BA%E7%AF%87%E7%AC%AC%E5%85%AD%E5%8D%81%E4%BA%94/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE/">素问</category><description>本文阐述了疾病的标本关系及针刺治疗的顺逆原则，强调治病需分主次、辨阴阳，并根据病情轻重、传变规律及四时变化制定治法，否则可能加重病情甚至导致死亡。</description></item></channel></rss>